// -----------------------------------------------------------------------
// Single shared metadata model — Fields -> Interfaces -> Flows -> Requirements
// This is the one thing every page (Glossary, Interface Index, Flow View,
// Traceability) reads from. Nothing below is duplicated per-page; each page
// just renders a different slice/view of the same records, referenced by ID
// — exactly the "one metadata source, compiled to static pages" model this
// mockup is illustrating.
//
// Worked example carried through all four views: the TMS <-> Shippeo
// "Create Plan" / "Plan Confirmation" exchange (INT-102 / INT-103).
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------

